@startuml ADRS-Use-Cases
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Student
actor Faculty
actor "OSA Staff" as OSA
actor "University of Baguio\nGoogle Account" as Google

rectangle "Attendance, Dropping and Readmission System" {
    usecase "Register / sign in" as UC_Auth
    usecase "View own attendance\nand enrollment status" as UC_StudentDashboard
    usecase "Submit readmission\nrequest" as UC_SubmitReadmission
    usecase "Track request status" as UC_TrackReadmission
    usecase "Manage courses,\nclass lists and schedules" as UC_Courses
    usecase "Record / import\nattendance" as UC_Attendance
    usecase "Review attendance history" as UC_History
    usecase "Record a student drop\nor OSA referral" as UC_Drop
    usecase "Switch OSA department" as UC_Department
    usecase "Review readmission\nrequest and documents" as UC_Review
    usecase "Approve, reject,\nor process excuse" as UC_Decision
    usecase "View drop and\nreadmission archives" as UC_Archive
    usecase "Export readmission records" as UC_Export
    usecase "Receive status\nnotifications" as UC_Notify
}

Student --> UC_Auth
Student --> UC_StudentDashboard
Student --> UC_SubmitReadmission
Student --> UC_TrackReadmission
Student --> UC_Notify

Faculty --> UC_Auth
Faculty --> UC_Courses
Faculty --> UC_Attendance
Faculty --> UC_History
Faculty --> UC_Drop

OSA --> UC_Auth
OSA --> UC_Department
OSA --> UC_Review
OSA --> UC_Decision
OSA --> UC_Archive
OSA --> UC_Export
OSA --> UC_Notify

Google --> UC_Auth
UC_Decision ..> UC_Review : <<include>>
UC_Notify ..> UC_Decision : follows decision

note right of UC_SubmitReadmission
Precondition: the student's enrollment
has already been dropped.
end note

note right of UC_Department
Department choices are currently configured
values. Information Technology (IT) is
the only configured department.
end note

@enduml

@startuml ADRS-Class-Model
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide methods

class User {
    user_id
    name
    email
    role
    google_id
    avatar_url
}

class Student {
    student_id
    student_number
    department
    program
    year_level
}

class FacultyMember {
    faculty_id
    full_name
    department
}

class OsaStaff {
    osa_id
}

class Guardian {
    guardian_id
    full_name
    email
}

class GuardianConsent {
    consent_id
    consent_type
    status
}

class SchoolYear {
    school_year_id
    year_label
    semester
    is_archived
}

class Course {
    course_id
    subject_code
    course_name
    section
}

class CourseSchedule {
    schedule_id
    day_of_week
    start_time
    end_time
    room
}

class Enrollment {
    enrollment_id
    status
    cycle_number
}

class AttendanceRecord {
    attendance_id
    session_date
    status
    hours_absent
    remarks
}

class DroppingTransaction {
    drop_id
    drop_date
    drop_type
    absence_hours_at_drop
}

class ReadmissionRequest {
    readmission_id
    attempt_number
    reason_code
    status
    outcome
}

class ExcuseDocument {
    document_id
    document_type
    file_path
}

class Notification {
    notification_id
    notification_type
    channel
    sent_at
}

User "1" -- "0..1" Student : student profile
User "1" -- "0..1" FacultyMember : faculty profile
User "1" -- "0..1" OsaStaff : OSA profile

Student "1" -- "0..*" Guardian
Guardian "1" -- "0..*" GuardianConsent
Student "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment
FacultyMember "1" -- "0..*" Course : teaches
SchoolYear "1" -- "0..*" Course
Course "1" -- "0..*" CourseSchedule
Course "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment

Enrollment "1" -- "0..*" AttendanceRecord
FacultyMember "1" -- "0..*" AttendanceRecord : records
Enrollment "1" -- "0..*" DroppingTransaction
FacultyMember "1" -- "0..*" DroppingTransaction : records drop
DroppingTransaction "1" -- "0..*" ReadmissionRequest : attempts
OsaStaff "0..1" -- "0..*" ReadmissionRequest : processes
ReadmissionRequest "1" -- "0..*" ExcuseDocument

ReadmissionRequest "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification
OsaStaff "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification : sends
Student "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification : receives
Guardian "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification : receives

note bottom of Student
Department is stored as text on the student
record; it is not yet a Department entity.
end note

note bottom of ReadmissionRequest
Multiple attempts are allowed per drop.
Each attempt has a unique attempt number
within that drop.
end note

@enduml

@startuml ADRS-Readmission-Workflow
autonumber
actor Student
participant "ADRS" as System
actor Faculty
actor "OSA Staff" as OSA

Faculty -> System : Record attendance
Faculty -> System : Record drop / refer student to OSA
System -> Student : Notify of dropped status

Student -> System : Submit readmission request\n(reason, details, required document, consent)
System -> System : Validate dropped enrollment and request
System -> OSA : Add request to selected department's queue

OSA -> System : Review request and supporting documents
alt Approved
    OSA -> System : Approve readmission
    System -> System : Set enrollment to readmitted
    System -> Student : Send approval notification
    System -> Faculty : Send approval notification
else Excused / needs revised request
    OSA -> System : Record excuse dates or mark not excused
    System -> Student : Send outcome and next-step notification
else Rejected
    OSA -> System : Reject with decision reason
    System -> Student : Send rejection notification
end

@enduml
